berga_trans_dash mobile target-language and toolchain compatibility patch.

Upstream base: mozilla/translations c75e5ba39856fe765850172f20f6177c5e7562e6.
The TargetArch, zlib, Pathie, Faiss, and Marian CMake changes are derived in
part from the MPL-2.0 patch in jesses2025smith/bergamot_translator commit
32b33b167c321f934e42f9482c3943a6c98c19da at
third_party/patches/00-bergamot-translator.patch (SHA-256
48dab92e7c77ad62e6b6673e1bf88a67142a8302835d82854fb7b8a64c6d1850).
Other upstream files retain their original MPL-2.0, MIT, BSD-2-Clause, or Zlib
terms. This patch plainly marks the altered zlib source as required by its
license.

